#. i18n: ectx: property (windowTitle), widget (QWidget)
#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QButtonGroup)
#. +> trunk
#: kcmtaskbarui.ui:16 kcmtaskbarui.ui:32
msgid "Taskbar"
msgstr "Programmbalken"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox)
#. +> trunk
#: kcmtaskbarui.ui:47
msgid "Show windows from all sc&reens"
msgstr "Finstern vun &all Schirmen wiesen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox)
#. +> trunk
#: kcmtaskbarui.ui:55
msgid ""
"Turning this option off will cause the taskbar to display <b>only</b> windows which are on the same Xinerama screen as the taskbar.\n"
"\n"
"By default, this option is selected and all windows are shown."
msgstr ""
"Wenn nich aktiveert, warrt <b>bloots</b> Finstern wiest, de op den sülven Xinerama-Schirm liggt as de Programmbalken.\n"
"\n"
"Standardwies is dat aktiveert, all Finstern warrt wiest."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox)
#. +> trunk
#: kcmtaskbarui.ui:63
msgid "Sort windows by desk&top"
msgstr "Finstern na Schrief&disch ornen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox)
#. +> trunk
#: kcmtaskbarui.ui:71
msgid ""
"Selecting this option causes the taskbar to show windows in order of the desktop they appear on.\n"
"\n"
"By default this option is selected."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt Finstern in de Reeg vun ehr Schriefdischen wiest.\n"
"\n"
"Standardwies is dat aktiveert."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox)
#. +> trunk
#: kcmtaskbarui.ui:96
msgid "&Show windows from all desktops"
msgstr "Finstern vun all &Schriefdischen wiesen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox)
#. +> trunk
#: kcmtaskbarui.ui:104
msgid ""
"Turning this option off will cause the taskbar to display <b>only</b> the windows on the current desktop. \n"
"\n"
"By default, this option is selected and all windows are shown."
msgstr ""
"Wenn nich aktiveert, warrt de Programmbalken <b>bloots</b> de Finstern vun den aktuellen Schriefdisch wiesen.\n"
"\n"
"Standardwies is dat aktiveert, all Finstern warrt wiest."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox)
#. +> trunk
#: kcmtaskbarui.ui:112
msgid "Sho&w application icons"
msgstr "Programm-&Lüttbiller wiesen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox)
#. +> trunk
#: kcmtaskbarui.ui:120
msgid ""
"Select this option if you want window icons to appear along with their titles in the taskbar.\n"
"\n"
"By default this option is selected."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn de Finster-Lüttbiller blang ehr Titeln op den Programmbalken wiest warrn schöölt.\n"
"\n"
"Standardwies is dat aktiveert."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox)
#. +> trunk
#: kcmtaskbarui.ui:128
msgid "Show window list &button"
msgstr "&Knoop för de Finsterlist wiesen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox)
#. +> trunk
#: kcmtaskbarui.ui:134
msgid "Selecting this option causes the taskbar to display a button that, when clicked, shows a list of all windows in a popup menu."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt en Knoop binnen den Programmbalken wiest, mit den Du en Menü för all Finstern wiesen laten kannst."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox)
#. +> trunk
#: kcmtaskbarui.ui:142
msgid "Show o&nly minimized windows"
msgstr "Bloots &minimeerte Finstern wiesen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox)
#. +> trunk
#: kcmtaskbarui.ui:147
msgid ""
"Select this option if you want the taskbar to display <b>only</b> minimized windows. \n"
"\n"
"By default, this option is not selected and the taskbar will show all windows."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn de Programmbalken <b>bloots</b>minimeerte Finstern wiesen schall.\n"
"\n"
"Disse Optschoon is standardwies nich aktiveert, all Finstern warrt wiest."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel)
#. +> trunk
#: kcmtaskbarui.ui:155
msgid "&Group similar tasks:"
msgstr "Lieke Finstern &tosamenfaten:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox)
#. +> trunk
#: kcmtaskbarui.ui:178
msgid ""
"The taskbar can group similar windows into single buttons. When one of these window group buttons are clicked on a menu appears showing all the windows in that group. This can be especially useful with the <em>Show all windows</em> option.\n"
"\n"
"You can set the taskbar to <strong>Never</strong> group windows, to <strong>Always</strong> group windows or to group windows only <strong>When the Taskbar is Full</strong>.\n"
"\n"
"By default the taskbar groups windows when it is full."
msgstr ""
"De Programmbalken kann lieke Finstern in een Knoop tosamenfaten. Wenn Du op so en Koppelknoop klickst, warrt en Menü mit all Finstern binnen den Koppel wiest. Tosamen mit de <em>All Finstern wiesen</em>-Optschoon kann dat bannig goot wesen.\n"
"\n"
"Du kannst fastleggen, dat de Programmbalken Finstern <strong>Nienich</strong>, <strong>Jümmers</strong>, oder bloots, <strong>Wenn de Programmbalken vull is</strong>, tosamenfaten schall.\n"
"\n"
"Standardwies faat de Programmbalken Finstern tosamen, wenn he vull is."

